    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-73656",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-13T19:56:04.286Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-13T19:56:04.286Z",
      "description": "Trigger.dev is a platform for building and deploying fully managed AI agents and workflows. Prior to 4.5.6, POST /api/v1/deployments/:deploymentId/background-workers calls CreateDeploymentBackgroundWorkerServiceV4.call() in apps/webapp/app/v3/services/createDeploymentBackgroundWorkerV4.server.ts, where workerDeployment.findFirst() selects a deployment by friendlyId without an environmentId predicate. A caller with a valid API key for one project can submit another project's deployment identifier, link an attacker-owned background worker to the victim deployment, and move the victim deployment from BUILDING to DEPLOYING. This issue is fixed in version 4.5.6.",
      "severity": 9.9,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：triggerdotdev trigger.dev\n🔓 漏洞类型：CWE-639, Missing Authorization (CWE-639, CWE-862)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/triggerdotdev/trigger.dev/security/advisories/GHSA-j6vv-pq9h-f4wj",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/triggerdotdev/trigger.dev/pull/4199",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/triggerdotdev/trigger.dev/commit/34b1a181c2a1d33a53ebab88f84b05f81fea4254",
          "type": "reference"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/triggerdotdev/trigger.dev/releases/tag/v4.5.2",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
      "affected": [
        {
          "vendor": "triggerdotdev",
          "product": "trigger.dev",
          "versions": [
            {
              "version": "< 4.5.2",
              "status": "affected"
            }
